[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3472223830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112198#issuecomment-3472223830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112198","id":3472223830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O9e5W","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T09:56:06Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T09:56:06Z","body":"I believe this is generally by design, when a control is pressed it receives focus and it will receive the release event of the original event regardless of where the release event happens, so it should still call the input method and you will need to mark the input as handled ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3472223830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3472423786","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112198#issuecomment-3472423786","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112198","id":3472423786,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O-Ptq","user":{"login":"vnznznz","id":1849859,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDk4NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1849859?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz","html_url":"https://github.com/vnznznz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vnznznz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T10:36:55Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T10:36:55Z","body":"The control that is hidden doesn't receive the release event, it goes directly to `_unhandled_input`. If you adjust my MRP like this it will never go into the `if event.is_action_released(\"left_click\"):` branch in the `gui_input` handler.\n\n``` GDScript\n@onready var texture_rect: TextureRect = $TextureRect\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\ttexture_rect.gui_input.connect(_on_icon_gui_input)\n\nfunc _on_icon_gui_input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif event.is_action_pressed(\"left_click\"):\n\t\ttexture_rect.visible = false\n\tif event.is_action_released(\"left_click\"):\n\t\tprint(\"%s _on_icon_gui_input: Click released\" % name)\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3472423786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3472553384","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112198#issuecomment-3472553384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112198","id":3472553384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O-vWo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T11:06:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T11:12:01Z","body":"I can confirm the behavior but can't speak to if it is intended or not, also not sure if this is specific to the use of the signal, but let's see what the input team has to say about this, at least this behavior should be documented if intentional","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3472553384/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]